<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt">Malaki</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino china ulotezi wa Malaki. Malaki fambulo jake kwa Chiebulania “Msenga wangu.” Ivo wasomi wamwenga wohuwila kuwa Malaki ni cheo siyo zina. Mulotezi kotambuligwa kwa nzila iyo muna isula ya 2:7. Ulotezi wa chitabu chino uwasonha Waisilaili viwabwelile kulawa Babeli kuutumwa na viwakomeleze kuzenga kaidi kaye ya Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulotezi wa Malaki una kuiswela hagati ya Mulungu na Waisilaili. Umo Mulungu kolagusa viya Waisilaili viweli hawaminika kwa kutenda mbuli hazifaya fana kulava nhambiko zihile (sula ya 1:8) na kuwasola wanaake watambikile nyang'hiti (sula ya 2:11). Kukala na Waisilaili wadodo wasamile. Ulotezi wa Malaki wolonga siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya nhaguso yahabehi. Siku iyo wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezadeng'helela, mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezatimbuligwa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1:1 yokwandusa kulonga ulotezi wa Malaki.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 1:2 mbaka sula ya 3:18 Mulungu koiswela na Waisilaili.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Sula ya 4 yogong'onda siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya nhaguso.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowalonda Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Malaki yawalongele Waisilaili.<verse eid="MAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nimulondani ng'hani.” Mbali mweye muniuza, “Kuchilonda vilihi? Vino Esau siyo ndugu yake Yakobo?” Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nimsagula Yakobo, <verse eid="MAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3" />mbali nimulema Esau na niitenda isi yake ya milima sekeiwe na chinhu, uhazi wake niweng'ha mbwizi wa kuichuwala.” <verse eid="MAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Waedomu wodaha kulonga, “Ingawa mabululu yetu yanangigwa, chizazenga kaidi matongo yake.” Mbali niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga, “Wodaha kuizenga kaidi, mbali nizaibomola. Waedomu wezatangigwa, ‘Wanhu wa isi ihile, waja woyowawonela ludoko Mndewa Mulungu siku zose.’ ” <verse eid="MAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />Muhawona mbuli izo kwa meso yenu, mwizavimanya na iviya mwizalonga, “Ukulu wa Mndewa Mulungu womanyika mbaka kunze ya Isilaili.”<verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowazuma wakulu wa nhambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Mwana komuhishimu tati yake, msang'hani komuhishimu mwenevale wake. One niye niiyo tati yenu, habali hamunihishimu? One niye niiyo mwenevale wenu, habali molema kunidumba? Nomulongelani mweye wakulu wa nhambiko munizeha niye. Mbali mweye mouza, ‘Chikuzeha vilihi?’ <verse eid="MAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />Munizeha kwa kunilavila ndiya haifaya muna ulupango lwangu. Mbali mweye mouza, ‘Chikuzeha vilihi?’ Kwa kulonga kuwa lupango lwa Mndewa Mulungu luzehigwa. <verse eid="MAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" />Muhanilavila nhambiko ya mnyama yatulike yameso hebu chilema hebu mtamu, vino uwo siyo wihi? Vino mtawala kezadeng'helelani hebu kezamtogolani?” Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga ivo. <verse eid="MAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" />Lelo mweye wakulu wa nhambiko mpuleni Mulungu muladi yachiwonele ubazi. One momulavila nhosa zilingile ivo, vino kweli kezamtemelani mate? <verse eid="MAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Muhavu yahapatike munhu imwe vimwili, iyo yahahindile nyivi za kaye ya Mulungu muladi sekemukwache moto bila faida muna ulupango lwangu. Sinogeligwa na mweye na sizaitogola nhambiko yoyose yomunilavila. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" />Nizatogozigwa na wanhu wa zisi zose, kwandusila ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa mbaka ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa. Chila hanhu wanifukizila ubani na wonilavila nhosa zozitogoligwa, kwaviya wonitogoza. <verse eid="MAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />Mbali mweye moniliga kwa kulutenda lupango lwangu lwambule mwiko na moyehula ndiya ilavigwa umo. <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" />Iviya molonga, ‘Mbuli zino zochilegeza ng'hani,’ na monizeha. Monigalila nhambiko za wanyama womubawile hebu weli vilema na watamu. Vino nihokele nhambiko zenu? Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga ivo. <verse eid="MAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" />Yaduwiligwe munhu yovwiza yeli na mnyama mulume muna dibumbila jake na yoilaha kumulava, mbali kamulavila Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi nhambiko ya mnyama yeli na chilema. Kwaviya niye mfalume mkulu, zina jangu dolondeka didumbigwe muna izisi zose.”<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kogendelela kuwazuma wakulu wa nhambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kowalongela wakulu wa nhambiko, “Mweye wakulu wa nhambiko nomulagilizani vino. <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" />One hamunitegeleze na kunihishimu, nizamduwilani na vinhu vonimwing'hileni nizaviduwila. Kweli nividuwila vimala, kwaviya hamuilungile kuzindilila malagilizo yangu. <verse eid="MAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" />Nizawatagusa wanenu kwa ichimu cha wihi wenu na nizamuhakani muna ivihanga venu mavi ya wanyama wenu wa nhambiko. Nizamwasani hamwe na nhambiko za madugila yenu. <verse eid="MAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" />Ivo mwizavimanya kuwa nimwing'hani lagilizo dino muladi lagano jangu na welesi wa Lawi digendelele. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga ivo. <verse eid="MAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" />Muna dilagano ijo niwalaganila ugima na tindiwalo na niweng'ha. Wawo walondeka kunitegeleza na wanitegeleza, wanidumba. <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" />Malagilizo ya kweli yakala muna imilomo yawo, hawakalile wavwizi. Niye na wawo chikala kwa tindiwalo na voilondeka, iviya wawafundiza wanhu wamwenga sekewatende uhasanyi. <verse eid="MAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" />Wakulu wa nhambiko wolondeka wawafundize wanhu kuvimanya kweli ya Mulungu. Wanhu wagendelele kuifunza vonilonda kumwawo, kwaviya wakulu wa nhambiko ni wasenga wa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi. <verse eid="MAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" />Mbali mweye wakulu wa nhambiko muhinduka na muleka kutenda voilondeka. Mafundizo yenu yawatenda wanhu wengi watende uhasanyi. Mubena lagano donitendile na Lawi. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga ivo. <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" />Nizamtendani mwehuligwe na musekigwe haulongozi ha wanhu wose, kwaviya hamunisondelele niye, mbali muwabagula wanhu muna ukuhumiza.”<verse eid="MAL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Yuda haweli waminika kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />Vino cheye chose siyo wana wa tata imwe? Vino hachilumbigwe na Mulungu imwe? Lelo habali choibiduka cheye kwa cheye na chodizeha lagano doyatendile Mndewa Mulungu na wasaho zetu? <verse eid="MAL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" />Wanhu wa Yuda haweli waminika kwa Mulungu na watenda mbuli za kutibusa muna iisi ya Isilaili na muna dibululu da Yelusalemu. Waizeha kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu iyoilonda. Iviya wawasola wanaake wotambikila milungu ya chigeni. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />Mndewa Mulungu yawasegeze kutali wanhu wotenda mbuli izo muna uwelesi wa Yakobo. Iviya sekewaihanganye na wayawo wolava nhambiko kwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi. <verse eid="MAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />Iviya molugubika lupango lwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa masozi yenu kuno molila na kuwa na giyogiyo kwaviya yeye hazitogola nhosa zomumulavila. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Mweye mouza, “Habali hazitogoligwa?” Mndewa Mulungu hazitogola kwaviya kavimanya kuwa kubena chilagano choumwikile muke umsolile ung'hali mbwanga. Huwile mwaminika kumwake ingawa kwika chilagano haulongozi wa Mulungu kuwa uhawile mwaminika kumwake. <verse eid="MAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" />Vino Mulungu hamtendileni mweye waidi muwe lukuli lumwe na muhe umwe? Vino kailunga choni viyatendile ivo? Kailunga cheleke wana wondawamtambikile yeye. Ivo chila mulume yawe mwaminika kwa muke wake iyamsolile yang'hali mbwanga. <verse eid="MAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili kolonga, “Nokwihila nyasa na nokwihila mulume yomtendela mbuli za usede muke wake. Ivo muiteganye sekemuleke kuwa waminika kwa wake zenu. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga ivo.”<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />Mumulegeza Mndewa Mulungu kwa mbuli zenu hazifaya. Mbali molonga, “Chimulegeza vilihi?” Mumulegeza kwa kulonga, “Chila munhu yotenda mbuli zihile kanoga haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu na kowadeng'helela.” Hebu kwa kuuza, “Mulungu yotenda voilondeka kakulihi?”<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Msenga yokwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Lola nomtuma msenga wangu yanilongolele kunisasalila nzila kuulongozi wangu. Mndewa yomumzahila kezaizila kaye yake kwa kusinhukiza. Loleni ija imsenga wa lagano imumdeng'helela kokwiza.”<verse eid="MAL 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" />Vino yelihi yondayafunye umoyo siku iyo vondayeze? Lelo yelihi yondayeme vondayalawlile yeye? Kwaviya yeye kalinga fana moto wa munhu yosunha hela, kalinga fana sabuni ya munhu yofuwa mawalo. <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" />Kezakala fana munhu yosunha hela na kuitenda iwe nzelu chwee. Nayo kezawasafya wana wa Lawi na kuwatenda wele fana viya zahabu na hela. Nawo wezamulavila Mndewa Mulungu nhosa zozitogoligwa. <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" />Ivo nhosa za wanhu wa Yuda na nhosa za Yelusalemu zizatogoleka na Mndewa Mulungu fana vizitogoleke umwaka. <verse eid="MAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Nizamkwenhukilani na kumtagusani. Sizadumba kuwalavila usindila wahawi na wazinzi na waja woilaha kwa uvwizi na waja wowabamanya wasang'hani na wowawonela wakefilwa na wachiwa na waja wowema nyambenyambe haki zawo, mbali hawanidumba niye.”<verse eid="MAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zaka na nhosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu sigaluka, lekamana mweye welesi wa Yakobo hamunangigwe.<verse eid="MAL 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />Kwandusila siku za wasaho zenu muhinduka ubanzi, muyaleka malagilizo yangu na hamuyazindilile. Ivo niye Mndewa Mulungu, Nili na Udahi nolonga, “Nibweleleni na niye nizambwelelani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:7">Mbali mweye mouza, “Chizakubwelele vilihi?”<verse eid="MAL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" />Vino munhu kodaha kumbawila Mulungu? Mbali mweye monibawila niye. Maabaho mouza, “Chokubawila vilihi?” Monibawila zaka na nhosa. <verse eid="MAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Mweye na isi ino yose muduwiligwa kwaviya monibawila. <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" />“Galeni zaka zose muna didungu jangu, muladi muna ikaye yangu muwe na ndiya ya kufaya. Munigeze kwa mbuli ino muladi muwone one sizavugula ulanga kumgalilani mvula na kumtemelani mate ng'hani, mbaka mswele dungu da kwika. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga ivo. <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />Nizawagomesa wang'onyo sekewabanange kaidi vinhu venu vimuhandile. Mizabibu yenu haizalagaza ng'hoga. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga ivo. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" />Wanhu wa zisi zose wezamtangani mweye, ‘Wanhu watemeligwe mate,’ kwaviya isi yenu izakuwa isi ya deng'ho ng'hani. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga ivo.”<verse eid="MAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Munilonga vihile.” Mbali muuza,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:13">“Chikulonga vihile vilihi?” <verse eid="MAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" />Mweye mulonga, “Kumsang'hanila Mulungu hakufaya chinhu. Vino kuzindilila malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu kofaya choni? Hebu kugeza kumulagusa kuwa chihasanya haulongozi wake kwa kugenda fana wanhu wolila kwa giyogiyo? <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" />Mbali sambi waja weli na magoda wotemeligwa mate. Kweli wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wokala goya. Iviya womgeza Mndewa Mulungu na hawatagusigwa.”<verse eid="MAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />Mbali wanhu waja womdumba yeye walonganya, nayo Mndewa Mulungu kategeleza na kahulika. Chitabu cha lukumbuso chandikigwa haulongozi wake kusonhela waja womdumba Mndewa Mulungu na kudihishimu zina jake.<verse eid="MAL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Wawo wezakuwa wanhu wangu. Wezakuwa ngama yangu. Nizawawonela ubazi fana viya tata viyomuwonela ubazi mwanage yomsang'hanila. <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />Baho mwizavimanya kaidi mbasakanyo ya munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile na munhu yotenda mbuli zihile, iviya mwizavimanya mbasakanyo ya munhu yomsang'hanila Mulungu na munhu hamsang'hanila Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Kweli siku yokwiza, yokwaka fana tanuli. Wanhu wose weli na chibuli na wotenda mbuli zihile wezakuwa makang'ha. Siku iyo ikwiza izawatimbula na haizaleka zizi hebu tambi. <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" />Mbali kumwenu womunihishimu, zuwa da haki dizamulawililani, dili na udahi wa kuhonya muna imilambi yake. Mweye mwizalawa kunze na mwizazumhazumha fana viya madang'ang'a viyolawa muna dibumba. <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />Muna isiku iyo yondanitende mbuli izo, mwizawabojoga wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile, kwaviya wezakuwa maivu hasi ya migulu yenu. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nolonga ivo. <verse eid="MAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />Muyakumbuke malagilizo ya Musa msang'hani wangu, malagilizo na ndagilizi zonimwing'hile uko Holebu kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili wose. <verse eid="MAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />Lola nizamgalilani mulotezi Eliya ing'hali hainafika siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa ija idumbiza. <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" />Mulotezi Eliya kezawatenda tata na iwana wawo wailonde, muladi sekenize kuitowa isi kwa kuiduwila.”<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>